# .gitignore for research_notebooks/truenas/
#
# This folder is a LOCAL STAGING MIRROR of the TrueNAS Gluetun Jupyter share
# (see README.md). Trevor copies the *whole* Jupyter tree down here, which drags
# along ~350 MB of data caches, run artifacts, and personal financial exports
# that must NOT enter git history.
#
# Intent: track only SOURCE — engine `.py`, notebooks (`.ipynb`), `.md` notes,
# and small hand-authored configs (e.g. controllers/*.yml). Everything bulky,
# regenerated, or personal is ignored below.
#
# Already handled by the repo-root .gitignore (not repeated here):
#   __pycache__/ , .ipynb_checkpoints , .Trash-0/

# --- Market-data caches (~137 MB of .npz OHLCV cache) ---
_ladder_cache/
*.npz

# --- Raw per-pair OHLCV/trade CSV extracts (~100 MB; re-pullable from notebooks) ---
# These are exchange data dumps named <PAIR>_<exchange>.csv, NOT the small report
# CSVs (ladder_report_*.csv, *final_summary*.csv) which stay tracked.
# Add new raw-extract pair prefixes here as they appear.
ETH-USDT_*.csv
SOL-USDT_*.csv
xmr_usdt_*.csv

# --- Regenerated run artifacts & diagnostics (large, reproducible) ---
artifacts/
**/artifacts/
diagnostics/
**/diagnostics/

# --- Archives / compressed dumps ---
*.zip
*.gz

# --- Personal / financial data — must NEVER be committed ---
# Quarantine folder: all personal-financial-holdings data was moved into
# notebooks/_private/ (tax backups, wallet histories, a balances notebook,
# db_backup, raw exchange CSV extracts, and the getdocumentation raw API dumps +
# generated docs that embed real, incompletely-redacted trade data). Originals
# live on the TrueNAS server; the generated docs regenerate via the scraper.
notebooks/_private/
_private/

# Belt-and-suspenders (in case such files reappear outside _private/):
logs/backup/
*.xlsx
